OL,3,ABank of England raises interest rates
OL,4,Ato 4%, the first increase in more than
OL,5,Athree years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank uses interest rates as a tool
OL,8,Fto help slow inflation - which is
OL,9,Fcurrently at 3.5%, above its 2% target
OL,10,F- by making borrowing more expensive
